--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compile-time only dependencies (NOT bundled)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are referenced at compile time but are NOT included in any
delivered jar. They are provided by the target runtime (Minecraft server
or proxy) and are the responsibility of that runtime:

- Paper API / Folia API  - GPL-3.0    (provided by PaperMC / Folia)
- Velocity API           - Apache-2.0 (provided by VelocityPowered)
- slf4j-api              - MIT
- Google Guice           - Apache-2.0

Because these are compile-time only and never redistributed by Mirage,
no license from these projects propagates to Mirage or its users.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
License compliance note
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mirage contains ZERO MySQL source code. It implements the MySQL wire
protocol independently and stores data in H2. The "no GPL contamination"
claim refers to the fact that no GPL-licensed code is bundled or linked
into the delivered artifacts.
